---
import BaseLayout from "../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
    title="About Us - TrendBriefly | Independent Tech & AI News"
    description="TrendBriefly delivers independent coverage of artificial intelligence, software engineering, and technology trends. Learn about our editorial standards, mission, and the team behind our expert guides."
    canonical="https://getnestdaily.xyz/pages/about/"
    ogImage="/assets/images/og-default.jpg"
>
    <section class="page-header">
        <div class="container">
            <h1>About TrendBriefly</h1>
            <p>
                Independent coverage of AI, software engineering, and technology
                trends ◆ written for developers and tech enthusiasts.
            </p>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="about-section">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="about-content">
                <h2>Who We Are</h2>
                <p>
                    TrendBriefly is an independent publication focused on
                    artificial intelligence, software engineering, and the
                    broader technology landscape. We cover AI developments,
                    emerging tools, programming best practices, hardware trends,
                    and the innovations shaping our digital future. Our goal is
                    straightforward: publish accurate, clearly written content
                    that respects the reader's time.
                </p>
                <p>
                    The site is run by a small team with backgrounds in software
                    development and technical writing. We do not operate as a
                    marketing outlet. We write about things we find genuinely
                    useful for developers, engineers, and anyone curious about
                    where technology is headed.
                </p>

                <h2>What We Publish</h2>
                <div class="about-topics">
                    <div class="topic">
                        <h3>Artificial Intelligence</h3>
                        <p>
                            In-depth coverage of AI tools, large language
                            models, machine learning breakthroughs, and how AI
                            is transforming industries from healthcare to
                            creative work.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="topic">
                        <h3>Software Engineering &amp; Dev Tools</h3>
                        <p>
                            Practical guides on programming languages,
                            frameworks, code editors, CI/CD pipelines, and
                            development best practices for modern engineering
                            teams.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="topic">
                        <h3>Tech Trends &amp; Hardware</h3>
                        <p>
                            Expert analysis of emerging technologies, new
                            hardware releases, gadget reviews, and the trends
                            defining the next generation of computing.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <h2>Editorial Standards</h2>
                <p>
                    We hold ourselves to a set of straightforward editorial
                    principles:
                </p>

                <div class="about-standards-table">
                    <table class="standards-table">
                        <thead>
                            <tr>
                                <th>Principle</th>
                                <th>What it means in practice</th>
                            </tr>
                        </thead>
                        <tbody>
                            <tr>
                                <td><strong>Accuracy</strong></td>
                                <td
                                    >We verify claims before publishing. If we
                                    make an error, we correct it promptly and
                                    note the correction.</td
                                >
                            </tr>
                            <tr>
                                <td><strong>Transparency</strong></td>
                                <td
                                    >Sponsored content and affiliate
                                    relationships are disclosed clearly. Opinion
                                    pieces are labeled as such.</td
                                >
                            </tr>
                            <tr>
                                <td><strong>Independence</strong></td>
                                <td
                                    >Editorial decisions are not influenced by
                                    advertisers. We do not accept payment to
                                    write positive reviews.</td
                                >
                            </tr>
                            <tr>
                                <td><strong>Currency</strong></td>
                                <td
                                    >Articles are reviewed periodically. Content
                                    that is no longer accurate is updated or
                                    retired.</td
                                >
                            </tr>
                        </tbody>
                    </table>
                </div>

                <h2>Advertising</h2>
                <p>
                    TrendBriefly displays ads through Google AdSense to support
                    the cost of running the site. Advertising does not influence
                    editorial decisions. You can read more in our <a
                        href="/pages/privacy-policy/">Privacy Policy</a
                    >.
                </p>

                <h2>Contact</h2>
                <p>
                    For questions, corrections, or collaboration inquiries,
                    reach us at <a href="mailto:hello@getnestdaily.xyz"
                        >hello@getnestdaily.xyz</a
                    > or visit our <a href="/pages/contact/">contact page</a>.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
</BaseLayout>
